---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const personId = 'https://freightgcc.com/author/wei-wong/#person';
const profilePage = {
  '@type': 'ProfilePage',
  mainEntity: { '@id': personId },
};
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Wei Wong — Author & Editorial Lead | Freightgcc"
  description="Wei Wong is the author and editorial lead of Freightgcc, a foreign trade and logistics professional with 20 years of experience and CEO of YIWU DINGWEI TRADING COMPANY."
  jsonLd={[profilePage]}
>
  <article>
    <h1>Wei Wong</h1>
    <p class="article-meta">Author and Editorial Lead · CEO, YIWU DINGWEI TRADING COMPANY · Last reviewed 16 November 2026</p>

    <p class="lede">
      Wei Wong is a foreign trade and logistics professional with 20 years of experience and CEO of
      YIWU DINGWEI TRADING COMPANY, the publisher of Freightgcc. At Freightgcc, Wei Wong is the author
      and editorial lead: the role covers topic selection, editorial review, corrections and the
      separation of editorial coverage from commercial enquiries.
    </p>

    <h2>Background</h2>
    <p>
      Wei Wong has worked in foreign trade and logistics for 20 years and is CEO of YIWU DINGWEI TRADING
      COMPANY. That operating background informs the site's focus on the decisions behind a shipment —
      route, port, customs, certification, cost and responsibility — rather than generic freight
      commentary.
    </p>

    <h2>What the role covers</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Editorial responsibility</strong> — deciding what is published under the Freightgcc name and answering for the judgement in a page.</li>
      <li><strong>Review</strong> — checking claims against the cited source, the methodology and the page's stated limits before publication.</li>
      <li><strong>Corrections</strong> — reviewing error reports and ensuring a material correction is recorded rather than silently replaced.</li>
      <li><strong>Commercial separation</strong> — keeping Sales enquiries separate from editorial decisions; coverage is not for sale.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Disclosure</h2>
    <p>
      Research and drafting are supported by AI tools under editorial direction. That assistance is
      disclosed rather than presented as unaided human research. This page states the author's role; it
      does not invent a professional licence, publication record or client list.
    </p>
    <p>
      Freightgcc is published by YIWU DINGWEI TRADING COMPANY, 3# Building, North Silicon Valley,
      Qiaodong District, Zhangjiakou City, Hebei, China. D-U-N-S Number: 585974555.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Editorial corrections and research questions:
      <a href="mailto:martin@freightgcc.com">martin@freightgcc.com</a>.
      For commercial enquiries, use <a href="/contact/">the contact page</a> and the Sales address;
      the <a href="/corrections/">corrections policy</a> explains what happens to an error report.
    </p>

    <section class="related">
      <h2>Related</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/about/">About Freightgcc</a></li>
        <li><a href="/methodology/">Methodology</a></li>
        <li><a href="/corrections/">Corrections policy</a></li>
        <li><a href="/contact/">Contact</a></li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
